      <MissionDesc>THE ALLIANT EDUCATIONAL FOUNDATION BUILDS BRIDGES BETWEEN UNDER-RESOURCED COMMUNITIES, UNIVERSITIES, AND OTHER ORGANIZATIONS TO CREATE A MORE EQUITABLE, HEALTHY, AND JUST SOCIETY.</MissionDesc>
